569
00:24:26,588 --> 00:24:28,157
Ja!

570
00:24:28,257 --> 00:24:30,119
Kev?

571
00:24:30,219 --> 00:24:33,909
Kevin. Hej, hej, hej.

572
00:24:34,009 --> 00:24:35,957
